            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Juliah Davis"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't use oil and instead heated them up in the butter. I did not mash them. I used dried mint because that's what I had. Kept the rest the same. They were yummy. Will do again for St Pat's day.",
            "datePublished": "2016-03-26T14:20:35.840Z"
