              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GoldenHen1500"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As an American, I've always been curious about peas and mash. I was considering making this recipe, but I saw that brown sugar is an ingredient. Is it supposed to be sweet? Ant mint? With peas? I can't fathom what that tastes like. Is mint and brown sugar absolutely necessary to be authentic peas and mash?",
