            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DREGINEK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made for St Patty’s Day Dinner and these were AWESOME! Fresh mint is the secret ingredient that wow, takes this over the top! After working my arm off trying to mash, I used my immersion blender - which did the trick! Would and will absolutely make again! Thank you Ella!!",
